WEBVTT

1
00:00.800 --> 00:03.857
<v Sonny>Three in the morning, baby. And the worst sound on the radio...

2
00:03.957 --> 00:06.728
<v Tiffani>Is, like, no sound. Ew.

3
00:09.129 --> 00:10.766
<v Tiffani>Which is why there's dead air.

4
00:10.865 --> 00:13.872
<v Sonny>An AI radio station... that you run yourself.

5
00:15.072 --> 00:18.190
<v Sonny>It picks the records. Hours of them, all lined up.

6
00:18.290 --> 00:21.505
<v Tiffani>Like, a whole running order. Not some random playlist.

7
00:22.705 --> 00:25.046
<v Tiffani>And it writes what we say between them.

8
00:25.147 --> 00:28.137
<v Sonny>Every fact with its source, sugar. Nothing made up.

9
00:29.337 --> 00:31.075
<v Sonny>Then it says it, on air...

10
00:31.175 --> 00:33.751
<v Tiffani>In our actual voices! Totally.

11
00:35.337 --> 00:38.668
<v Tiffani>And it plays your music. From the library you already have.

12
00:38.768 --> 00:40.633
<v Sonny>Your records. Not ours.

13
00:41.833 --> 00:44.641
<v Sonny>One stream. Everybody hearing the same thing...

14
00:44.741 --> 00:47.817
<v Tiffani>At the same moment. Which is, like, so radio.

15
00:49.117 --> 00:49.842
<v Tiffani>Dead air.

16
00:49.943 --> 00:51.320
<v Sonny>Never dead air again.
